+- What actually splits is the **site-extension** counit/unit for
+  PSh(A) -> Sh(B) -> PSh(A): for a general presheaf H on A_P (NOT a
+  sheaf), H -> j_* j^{-1} H with j: Sh(B) -> PSh(A) need not take values
